d in your way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423810/extras/Boss.gif?t=1743693179\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423810/extras/TitulosSteam2En.png?t=1743693179\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between battles, upgrade your weapons, unlock new magical powers, and acquire powerful items that boost your abilities. Your journey through the supernatural Old West is full of choices:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weapon and Magic Combos:</strong> Mix and match firearms and spells to create the ultimate combat strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Permanent Progression:</strong> Gather resources from each run to permanently improve your character and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Item Shop:</strong> Visit mysterious merchants to unlock new weapons, upgrades, and other essentials for survival.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423810/extras/LevelUp.gif?t=1743693179\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423810/extras/TitulosSteam4En.png?t=1743693179\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every failure brings new knowledge, power, and a second chance. As you die and restart, you'll discover new secrets, abilities, and NPCs that change your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Replayability:</strong> Every run feels different with procedurally generated levels, items, and enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rich Lore and Hidden Mysteries:</strong> Dive into a deep and dark story as you uncover the truth behind the undead invasion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meet Strange Characters:</strong> Encounter NPCs with their own backstories, each revealing pieces of a larger mystery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423810/extras/NPC_dialogue.gif?t=1743693179\" /></p>","developers":["Ace Horizon Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3213790","name":"Red Pistol"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423810/header.jpg?t=1743693179","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257101471,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101471/movie480.mp4?t=1740355519","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101471/movie_max.mp4?t=1740355519"},"name":"Red Pistol Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257101471/b9057ed8aec35de507b8e00a33ce57b06f902eda/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740355519","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101471/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740355519","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101471/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740355519"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257099770,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099770/movie480.mp4?t=1740355521","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099770/movie_max.mp4?t=1740355521"},"name":"Red Pistol Trailer 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257099770/bca2c1608af7c03edb8ffc275629e843e51dcadb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740355521","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099770/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740355521","max":"http://video.akamai.st